Convx bundles source vendored from third-party open-source projects.

## Lyrics providers

The provider clients and lyric parsers in lyrics/.../lyrics/bitchord are
adapted from BitChord (https://github.com/kushagrasinghx/BitChord),
Copyright its contributors, licensed under GPL-3.0. See LICENSE.

## Flamingo lyrics and player controls

The renderer in app/.../ui/component/flamingo and player chrome values
are adapted from Flamingo (https://github.com/shouryadixitisverycool/Flamingo),
by Yos-X and contributors, licensed under GPL-3.0. See LICENSE.

## hig module

Portions of the `hig/` module are vendored from compose-hig
(https://github.com/ienground/compose-hig), Copyright (c) IENGROUND of IENLAB
and prior contributors (Compose Cupertino project, Scott Lanoue), licensed
under the Apache License, Version 2.0. See hig/LICENSE for the full license
text and individual file headers for per-file copyright notices.

## Artwork transitions

The artwork transition timing in `artwork/` is adapted from MeloX-Android
(https://github.com/lladlam/MeloX-Android), licensed under GPL-3.0.
See the repository LICENSE for the license text.

## YouTube video discovery

Official music video matching is adapted from Square
(https://github.com/Lelonio/Square), licensed under GPL-3.0.

## Base project

Convx was originally built on an open-source GPL-3.0 music player and has since diverged
completely. It remains licensed under the GNU General Public License v3.0 (see LICENSE).
